  "intuition": "This loss encourages ordering of pairs based on the cost gap signal, which measures the difference in actual costs between chosen and alternative options, promoting preference for lower-cost choices. Incorporating the log probabilities ensures it is a likelihood-based comparison, suitable for RL settings where relative rankings are crucial.",
